      en: ["Established in 1933 on the northern outskirts of Dushanbe.", "The total area of the garden is approximately 40 hectares.", "Contains a collection of more than 4,500 plant species.", "Famous for its intricately carved traditional wooden pavilions.", "Serves as the main base for the Botanical Institute of the Academy.", "Features an extensive arboretum with rare tree specimens."],
